  "notes": "Official Sample Course Schedule: Bachelor of Science in Nursing for students entering Fall 2026, jointly published by Blessing-Rieman College of Nursing & Health Sciences and Quincy University (dated 2026-01-30). The QU BSN is delivered in partnership with Blessing-Rieman College of Nursing and Health Sciences (BRCN), Quincy, IL; nursing courses begin in the sophomore year with most junior/senior classes on the BRCN campus. 124 total semester hours. BIO 232 Microbiology is offered every fall; BIO 354 Pathophysiology is offered every spring. Prerequisite GPA 2.7 required for admission; cumulative GPA 2.7 for progression/graduation; nursing GPA 2.7 for progression. NSG 324 Scope of LPN Practice (3 cr, summer) is an optional LPN-ladder course and is NOT included in this plan. GED XXX / ENG 2XX / NSG XXX are elective slots filled by the student (marked choice). See the Quincy University catalog for all Bonaventure Program requirements.",
